cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ImagePro Classifier Teaching Tool"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit teaching app for training a two-class image classifier.
  Users upload two labeled image sets, train the classification head of
  a ResNet-18 (ImageNet-pretrained or randomly initialized), and classify
  a test image.
license: MIT
authors:
